    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "helmet with white hair coming out of the top, making the wearer look like an old person",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "舞台の奴役が被る老頭は、白い毛が飛び出している。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その役者の老頭姿は、観客を笑わせた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "歌舞伎の老頭は代表的な舞台道具である。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "この絵看板の沼は、あの「いかぬ老頭」の庭の池を神秘めかしてかいたのだろう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "黄村先生言行録",
                "author": "太宰治",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "それでは、事実、あれが「いかぬ老頭」の池に棲息していたのに違いない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "黄村先生言行録",
                "author": "太宰治",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "kanji \"old\" radical at top",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「老」という文字の上部の老頭は、年老いた人の姿を表している。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "老頭の書き方は楷書と行書で異なる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "字典では老頭を含む漢字が一覧にまとめられている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
